			"notes": "## Version 0.2.0\n\n### New Features\n- **AI Changes**:\n    - **Witches**: Witches can now buff Illagers using potions.\n    - **Illagers**: Illagers can now run to witches for healing and protection potions.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- **Configuration**: Fixed some config-related crashes and issues\n  - Game would crash when:\n    - `attributes`, `equipment`, or `effects` was not defined on an entity modifier.\n      These should have been optional.\n    - `weight` for WeightedEntries did not exist.\n  - Mobs did not spawn when:\n    - `attributes`, `equipment`, or `effects` did not contain any entries."
		},
